        "164572426857089649-0": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I change my order after placing it?",
            "text": "<p>If you suddenly have a change of heart over the delicious smoothie flavours you would like to get your hands on, just drop us a message and we'll try our best to accommodate you. Please note, we will not be able to amend orders once they have been shipped.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "164572426857089649-1": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why do some flavours show as out of stock?",
            "text": "<p>We try our very best to source the best ingredients possible all year round, however we can encounter temporary shortages of certain ingredients from time to time, dependent on the season. Some of our smoothie flavours may show as out of stock if we are unable to source any of our ingredients, but as soon as we are able to get our hands on them, they will become available again.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "164572426857089649-2": {
          "type": "tab_content",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do you source your ingredients from?",
            "text": "<p>We aim to use as much as we can from local sources in Australia, but if that's not possible then we will reach out across the world to sustainable suppliers!<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "164572426857089649-0",
        "164572426857089649-1",
        "164572426857089649-2"
